<title>NETHERLANDS: HEIJMANS TAKES OVER E. DE VRIES.</title>
<headline>HEIJMANS TAKES OVER E. DE VRIES.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Construction firm Heijmans NV said it had agreed to take over E. de Vries Holding, an engineering, installation and machinery firm based in IJmuiden.</p>
<p>Heijmans said it would pay an undisclosed cash sum for De Vries which has 120 employees and annual sales of some 22 million guilders.</p>
<p>Heijmans said De Vries would make a positive contribution to its earnings.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
